# One line away from default: production tilts toward the layers the
# opponent is seen fielding, instead of holding the stated mix regardless.
#
# NOTE: against these all-tank goals the flag is inert -- the tilt only ever
# repeats anti-air already in the mix, and this mix has none. The live
# counter experiment is doctrines/aa.doctrine vs doctrines/aa-counter.doctrine
# (sweeps/counter-ab.txt). This file exists as the minimal one-field arm
# against default, pinned by test.

name counter
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank
heavies none
max_workers 4
mass 7
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 1
intercept 0
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
tech 0
